==Cultivation==
[[Image:Gentiana paradoxa (1).jpg|thumb|''Gentiana paradoxa'']]
Several gentian species may be found in cultivation, and are valued for the unusual intensity of their blue flowers. They have a reputation for being difficult to grow. All require similar conditions – moist, rich, free-draining soil with an acid to neutral pH. They include:<ref name=RHSAZ/>
{{div col|colwidth=30em}}
*[[Gentiana acaulis|''G. acaulis'']]
*[[Gentiana asclepiadea|''G. asclepiadea'']]
*[[Gentiana paradoxa|''G. paradoxa'']]
*[[Gentiana septemfida|''G. septemfida'']]
*[[Gentiana sino-ornata|''G. sino-ornata'']]
{{div col end}}

